### Create (works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "company": "Systems Ltd", "jobTitle": "Junior MERN Developer", "location": "Lahore" }

### Read all
GET http://localhost:5000/api/applications

### Read all (filtered)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/applications?status=Interview

### Read one (replace the ID)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/applications/PASTE_ID_HERE

### Update (replace the ID)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/applications/PASTE_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Interview", "interviewDate": "2026-12-05" }

### Delete (replace the ID)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/applications/PASTE_ID_HERE

### Error test: missing company (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "jobTitle": "Developer" }
